{"sha": "b41707b821e3f37866de055dd45b0e5ca02b29b4957d5e14a96d6beb4d0f513c", "body": ["\\chapter{Thales' Theorem}\\label{ch:g9:thales}", "", "不爬上去，你如何测量棱锥的高度？米利都的泰勒斯", "把它的影子与一根木棍的影子作了比较。", "他的定理——平行线截得的线段成比例——", "是比例模型、地图与放大图的数学核心，", "也是最古老的有名字的定理之一。", "", "\\section{定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[泰勒斯]\\label{thm:g9:thales:direct}", "设两条直线交于点 $A$，在第一条直线上取 $M$，", "在第二条直线上取 $N$，其中 $B$ 为第一条直线上较远的点，", "$C$ 为第二条直线上较远的点。若直线 $(MN)$ 与 $(BC)$ \\emph{平行}，则", "三角形 $AMN$ 与 $ABC$ 的对应边成比例：", "\\[", "\\frac{AM}{AB} = \\frac{AN}{AC} = \\frac{MN}{BC}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (5.0,0.6);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (3.2,2.8);", "  \\coordinate (M) at ($(A)!0.55!(B)$);", "  \\coordinate (N) at ($(A)!0.55!(C)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (M) -- (N);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (B) -- (C);", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill (M) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$M$};", "  \\fill (N) circle (1.5pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$N$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hspace{1.1cm}%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (2.6,-1.3);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (1.4,-2.2);", "  \\coordinate (M) at ($(A)!-0.62!(B)$);", "  \\coordinate (N) at ($(A)!-0.62!(C)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (M) -- (B);", "  \\draw[thick] (N) -- (C);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (M) -- (N);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (B) -- (C);", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[right=2pt, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill (M) circle (1.5pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$M$};", "  \\fill (N) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$N$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 泰勒斯定理的两种构型：嵌套三角形（左）与", "“蝴蝶形”，其中 $M$ 与 $N$ 位于 $A$ 的另一侧（右）。", "两图中均有 $(MN) \\parallel (BC)$，且三个比值相等。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[用泰勒斯定理计算长度]\\label{met:g9:thales:compute}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 找出两直线相交的点 $A$ 以及两条", "        平行线，并为两个三角形命名；", "  \\item 写出三个相等的比，且始终为“小三角形", "        比大三角形”；", "  \\item 保留涉及三个已知长度与未知长度的两个比", "        相等的关系；", "  \\item 通过交叉相乘解所得的比例式。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:thales:compute}", "在上图左侧的构型中，设 $AM = 3$，$AB = 5$，$AN = 2.4$", "且 $MN = 3.3$，求 $AC$ 与 $BC$。由泰勒斯定理得", "\\[", "\\frac{AM}{AB} = \\frac{AN}{AC} = \\frac{MN}{BC},", "\\qquad\\text{即}\\qquad", "\\frac35 = \\frac{2.4}{AC} = \\frac{3.3}{BC}.", "\\]", "由 $\\frac35 = \\frac{2.4}{AC}$，交叉相乘得", "$3 \\times AC = 5 \\times 2.4 = 12$，所以 $AC = 4$。另由", "$\\frac35 = \\frac{3.3}{BC}$ 得 $3 \\times BC = 16.5$，所以 $BC = 5.5$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[生活中的泰勒斯定理]\\label{ex:g9:thales:stick}", "一根高 $1$ m 的竖直木棍投下长 $1.5$ m 的影子，同一时刻一棵树", "投下长 $12$ m 的影子。太阳光线平行，因此", "木棍与影子所成的三角形、树与影子所成的三角形", "处于泰勒斯构型：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\text{树高}}{1} = \\frac{12}{1.5},", "\\qquad\\text{所以树高为 } 8 \\text{ m。}", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{逆定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[泰勒斯定理的逆定理]\\label{thm:g9:thales:converse}", "点的放置方式与\\cref{thm:g9:thales:direct}所示相同（$M$ 在 $(AB)$ 上，", "$N$ 在 $(AC)$ 上，两条直线上的点顺序相同）：", "若", "\\[", "\\frac{AM}{AB} = \\frac{AN}{AC},", "\\]", "则直线 $(MN)$ 与 $(BC)$ 平行。", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{method}[证明或否定平行关系]\\label{met:g9:thales:converse}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 分别计算两个比 $\\dfrac{AM}{AB}$ 与", "        $\\dfrac{AN}{AC}$（保留为分数，不作四舍五入）；", "  \\item 若二者相等，\\emph{且}两点在两条直线上的顺序相同，", "        则两直线平行（泰勒斯定理的逆定理）；", "  \\item 若二者不相等，则两直线\\emph{不}平行——因为若它们平行，", "        由泰勒斯定理必有两个比相等。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}